 (group repo tag)←ParseReadmeSourceUrl sourceUrl;parts;bool;searchString;path
⍝ Takes the URL a README was fetched from, as `GetReadmeUrls` composed it -
⍝ https://github.com/<group>/<repo>/blob/<tag>/README.md - and takes it apart again.
⍝ Returns three empty vectors when it is not of that shape, which is the caller's signal to
⍝ leave relative links alone rather than to point them somewhere invented.
 (group repo tag)←'' '' ''
 searchString←'github.com/'
 :If ∨/bool←searchString⍷⎕C sourceUrl
     path←((≢searchString)+¯1+bool⍳1)↓sourceUrl     ⍝ Keep the original case: paths are case sensitive
     parts←{1↓¨(⍵='/')⊂⍵}'/',path
     :If 5=≢parts
     :AndIf 'blob'≡⎕C 3⊃parts
         (group repo tag)←parts[1 2 4]
     :EndIf
 :EndIf
